n                         }\n                                 \n                         if (spendTime < 3)\n                         {\n                             spendTime += Time.deltaTime;\n                             yield return null;\n                         }\n                         else\n                         {\n\n```\n\n## 完整变更文件\n\n### Game/Assets/_Script/PVP/PVPMap.cs\n```csharp\n//#define TEST_ENABLED\n\n#define TELEPORT_LITE\n\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing _Script.AllianceWorld;\nusing _Script.BattleRoyale;\nusing _Script.Camp.CampMain;\nusing _Script.ChristmasTree;\nusing _Script.ExploreTreasure;\nusing _Script.FamousCityPlay;\nusing _Script.FantasyWorld;\nusing _Script.FantasyWorld.FantasyManager;\nusing _Script.FantasyWorld.FantasyManager.S18;\nusing _Script.FantasyWorld.FantasyWorldSea;\nusing _Script.FantasyWorldS7.Guild;\nusing _Script.KingdomMap.Tile;\nusing _Script.KingdomMap.Tile.ExploreTile;\nusing _Script.LostBattlefield;\nusing _Script.LunarWorldBoss;\nusing _Script.PVP.Map;\nusing _Script.SecretTeam;\nusing ClientCore.ReloadModeSupport;\nusing ColorMesh;\nusing Config2;\nusing DB;\nusing FunPlus.AssetManager;\nusing Gw.Terrain;\nusing I2.Loc;\nusing NisaSeason;\nusing UI;\nusing UI.Intelligence;\nusing UIOptimize.AllianceFortressStonePopup.AllianceFortressStonePopup;\nusing UIOptimize.AllianceMineDetailPopup.AllianceMineDetailPopup;\nusing UIOptimize.AllianceMineSmallBoxDetailPopup.AllianceMineSmallBoxDetailPopup;\nusing UIOptimize.FamousCitySmallBoxDetailPopup.FamousCitySmallBoxDetailPopup;\nusing UIOptimize.FamousCityWarInfoPopup.FamousCityWarInfoPopup;\nusing UIOptimize.KingdomExploreTreasureDetailPopup.KingdomExploreTreasureDetailPopup;\nusing UIOptimize.SeasonAllianceFortressStonePopup.SeasonAllianceFortressStonePopup;\nusing UIOptimize.TELEPORT_COMBINATION_HIGH_LIGHT.TELEPORT_COMBINATION_HIGH_LIGHT;\nusing UIOptimize.TELEPORT_KINGDOMEXPLORE_HIGH_LIGHT.TELEPORT_KINGDOMEXPLORE_HIGH_LIGHT;\nusing UniRx;\nusing UnityEngine;\nusing XTutorial;\n#if UNITY_EDITOR\nusing UnityEditor;\n#endif\n\npublic enum PVPMapMode\n{\n    Normal, //普通\n    Teleport, //传送\n    Turret, //\n    TeleportCombination, //组合版传送\n    MultipleSpell, //\n    SingleSpell, //\n\n    Explore,//探索模式\n    FantasyTowerTurret, //幻想世界放置插旗\n    FantasySummonRuin, //幻界召唤遗迹\n}\n\n/// <summary>\n/// 大地图标记 更新 类型枚举\n/// </summary>\npublic enum WORLD_MARK_UPDATE_TYPE\n{\n    FIRST_ENTTER_KINGDOWM = 1,\n    ALLIANCE_MARK_DB_CHANGED = 2,\n    ALLIANCE_JOIN_EVENT = 3,\n    ALLIANCE_LEAVE_EVENT = 4,\n\n    ORGANIZATION_MARK_DB_CHANGED = 5,//联盟之外的其他组织标记\n    FANTASY_S7_GUILD_MARK_DB_CHANGED = 6,\n}\n\npublic class ShowHighlightEvt\n{\n    public TileData Tile;\n}\n\npublic class HideHighlightEvt\n{\n}\n\npublic struct GotoLocationOver\n{\n    \n}\n\npublic delegate bool MethodDelegate(TileData data);\n\n\npublic partial class PVPMap : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    private long _dragCount;\n\n    public long DragCount => _dragCount;\n\n    //const int HOW_MUCH_TO_EXPAND_TO_ONE_SIDE = 2;\n    private CompositeDisposable _disposables = new CompositeDisposable();\n\n    public static event MethodDelegate CheckCanClick;\n\n    static Dictionary<int, string> AllAllianceBuildingPrefabNames = new Dictionary<int, string>\n    {\n        { AllianceBuildingType.FORTRESS, \"tiles_alliance_fortress\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.WATCHTOWER, \"tiles_alliance_turret\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.WAREHOUSE, \"tiles_alliance_storehouse\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.FARM, \"tiles_alliance_farm\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.SAWMILL, \"tiles_alliance_sawmil\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.MINE, \"tiles_alliance_mine\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.HOUSE, \"tiles_alliance_house\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.PORTAL, \"tiles_alliance_portal\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.HOSPITAL, \"tiles_alliance_hospital\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.DRAGON_ALTAR, \"tiles_alliance_dragon_altar\" },\n        { AllianceBuildingType.WAR_TOWER, \"tiles_alliance_turret\" },\n    };\n\n    [ReloadWithNewInstance(typeof(ShowHighlightEvt))]\n    static ShowHighlightEvt ShowHighlightEvt = new ShowHighlightEvt();\n\n    [ReloadWithNewInstance(typeof(HideHighlightEvt))]\n    static HideHighlightEvt HideHighlightEvt = new HideHighlightEvt();\n\n    public static string GetAllianceBuildingPrefabByBuildingId(int allianceBuildingId)\n    {\n        AllianceBuildingsInfo buildingInfo = ConfigManager2.Instance.DB_AllianceBuildings.Get(allianceBuildingId);\n        if (buildingInfo != null)\n        {\n            return GetAllianceBuildingPrefab(buildingInfo.BuldingType);\n        }\n\n        throw new Exception(\n            $\"PVPMap::GetAllianceBuildingPrefabByBuildingId({allianceBuildingId}) -> invalid allianceBuildingId\");\n    }\n\n    public static string GetAllianceBuildingPrefab(int allianceBuildingType)\n    {\n        string result = \"tiles_alliance_fortress\";\n        AllAllianceBuildingPrefabNames.TryGetValue(allianceBuildingType, out result);\n        return result;\n    }\n\n    [Tooltip(\"All possible tile prefabs goes here for reference\")]\n    public Transform Resources;\n    public Transform Cities;\n    public Transform Monsters;\n    public Transform Wonders;\n    public Transform Terrains;\n    public Transform Water;\n    public Transform Fortress;\n    public Transform Bannar;\n    public Transform Decoration;\n    public Transform VFX;\n    public Transform DigTreasure;\n    public Transform GodStone;\n\n    [SerializeField] private ColorMeshHelper _colorMeshHelper;\n    [SerializeField] private ColorMeshHelper _colorMeshHelperFactionA;\n    [SerializeField] private ColorMeshHelper _colorMeshHelperFactionB;\n\n    private bool _forceUpdate;\n    private GameObject _fogGo;\n\n    public bool IsAllianceZoneBorderRenderBusy\n    {\n        get\n        {\n            return _colorMeshHelper.IsProcessing ||\n                   _colorMeshHelperFactionA.IsProcessing ||\n                   _colorMeshHelperFactionB.IsProcessing;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public bool ForceUpdate\n    {\n        get { return _forceUpdate; }\n        set { _forceUpdate = value; }\n    }\n\n    [HideInInspector] public bool ForceSync; //强制网络请求地块信息\n    private Dictionary<string,List<GameObject>> _bookMarkGos = new Dictionary<string,List<GameObject>>(5);\n\n    GameObject m_CircleNode;\n    TileData m_SelectedTile;\n    Vector3 _lastTarget = Vector3.zero;\n    GameObject _highlight;\n    private GameObject _marchArrow;\n    GameObject _wallHighlight;\n    GameObject _circleNode;\n    TileData _selectedTile;\n    //Coordinate _startKXY = new Coordinate(0, 0, 0);\n    Coordinate _currentKXY = new Coordinate(0, 0, 0);\n    private Coordinate _previousKXY = new Coordinate(0, 0, 0);\n    DynamicMapData _mapData;\n    long _lastKingdomId;\n\n    public static float TileMapScale; // 0.01f\n    public static float InverseTileMapScale; // 100f\n\n    private AllianceZoneClosedZoneLine _buildingZoneView; //点击有领地功能的建筑，显示的范围。\n\n    private List<GameObject> passHightLightList = new List<GameObject>();\n\n    public TileData SelectedTile\n    {\n        get { return _selectedTile; }\n    }\n\n    public Coordinate CurrentKXY\n    {\n        get { return _currentKXY; }\n        set\n        {\n            if (TileCamera.IsAvailable())\n            {\n                TileCamera.Instance.CurViewKingdomId = value.K;\n            }\n\n            //当前所在 kid发生变化，更新数据缓存\n            if (value.K != _currentKXY.K)\n            {\n                UpdateCacheData(value.K);\n            }\n\n            if (value != _currentKXY)\n            {\n                if (_currentKXY == Coordinate.zero)\n                    _previousKXY = value;\n                else\n                    _previousKXY = _currentKXY;\n            }\n            \n            _currentKXY = value;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public Coordinate PreviousKXY => _previousKXY;\n\n    public DynamicMapData MapData => _mapData;\n\n    public long LastKingdomId => _lastKingdomId;\n    [ReloadWithValue(null)]\n    public static Coordinate PendingGotoRequest;\n    [ReloadWithValue(false)] public static bool ShowCircle;\n    [ReloadWithNewInstance(typeof(Coordinate))]\n    public static Coordinate CircleLocation;\n\n    PVPMapMode m_PVPMapMode = PVPMapMode.Normal;\n\n    #region 地图偏移量变化须更新数据缓存\n\n    private void UpdateCacheData(long kId)\n    {\n        //更新camera boundary\n        UpdateCameraBoundary();\n\n        //更新block数据\n        _mapData?.UpdateCacheData();\n\n        //更新march path\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_March.RecalculateWorldInformation();\n\n        //当前kid变化事件推送\n        EventManager.Instance.PushEvent(EventDef.ON_CUR_KINGDOM_ID_UPDATE, kId);\n    }\n\n    #endregion\n\n    #region 更新PreviousXYZ\n\n    public void SyncCurrentXYZToCache()\n    {\n        SetPreviousXYZ(CurrentKXY);\n    }\n\n    public void SetPreviousXYZ(Coordinate cor)\n    {\n        _previousKXY = cor;\n    }\n    \n    #endregion\n    \n#if TELEPORT_LITE\n    private TeleportHighlightLite m_TeleportHighlight;\n    private AllianceTurretHighlightLite m_AllianceTurrentHighlight;\n    private TELEPORT_COMBINATION_HIGH_LIGHT _teleportCombinationHighLight;\n    private TELEPORT_KINGDOMEXPLORE_HIGH_LIGHT _teleportKingdomExploreHighLight;\n#else\n    TeleportHighlight m_TeleportHighlight;\n    AllianceTurretHighlight m_AllianceTurrentHighlight;\n#endif\n    SingleCastSpellDialog m_SingleCastSpellDialog;\n    SingleCastSpellSelection m_SingleCastSpellSelection;\n    SpellRangeHighlight m_SpellRangeHighlight;\n\n    private string SINGLE_CAST_SPELL_SELECTION_PREFAB_PATH = \"Prefab/Kingdom/SINGLE_CAST_SPELL_SELECTION\";\n\n    public bool AutoExitHideHUD = false;\n\n    public TeleportMode GetCurrentTeleportMode()\n    {\n        if (m_TeleportHighlight != null)\n        {\n            return m_TeleportHighlight.GetTeleportMode();\n        }\n\n        return TeleportMode.ADVANCE_TELEPORT;\n    }\n\n    //public void EnterMultipleSpellMode(TempleSkillInfo skillInfo)\n\n    public void EnterMultipleSpellMode(AllianceTempleSkillInfo skillInfo)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.MultipleSpell);\n        m_SingleCastSpellDialog.SetData(skillInfo);\n\n        WorldCoordinate worldCoords = _mapData.ConvertTileKXYToWorldCoordinate(CurrentKXY);\n        m_SpellRangeHighlight.Setup(worldCoords, skillInfo);\n    }\n\n    public void EnterMultipleSpellMode(AllianceTempleSkillInfo skillInfo, Coordinate location)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.MultipleSpell);\n        m_SingleCastSpellDialog.SetData(skillInfo);\n\n        WorldCoordinate worldCoords = _mapData.ConvertTileKXYToWorldCoordinate(location);\n        m_SpellRangeHighlight.Setup(worldCoords, skillInfo);\n    }\n\n    public void ConfirmMultipleSpellMagic()\n    {\n        if (m_SpellRangeHighlight != null)\n        {\n            m_SpellRangeHighlight.OnConfirmPressed();\n        }\n    }\n\n    public void EnterSingleSpellMode(AllianceTempleSkillInfo skillInfo,\n        TempleSkillUseFrom skillUseFrom = TempleSkillUseFrom.NONE)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.SingleSpell);\n        m_SingleCastSpellDialog.SetData(skillInfo, skillUseFrom);\n    }\n\n    public void EnterSingleSpellMode(KingSkillInfo skillInfo)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.SingleSpell);\n        m_SingleCastSpellDialog.SetData(skillInfo);\n    }\n\n    public void EnterSingleSpellMode(FactionSkillInfo skillInfo)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.SingleSpell);\n        m_SingleCastSpellDialog.SetData(skillInfo);\n    }\n \n\n    public void EnterSingleSpellMode(FantasyAllianceSkillInfo skillInfo,TempleSkillUseFrom skillUseFrom)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.SingleSpell);\n        m_SingleCastSpellDialog.SetData(skillInfo,skillUseFrom);\n    }\n\n    public void EnterSingleSpellMode(FantasyGuildSkillInfo skillInfo)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.SingleSpell);\n        m_SingleCastSpellDialog.SetData(skillInfo);\n        UIManager.inst.publicHUD.SetSpellAllianceMagicBtnContent(Utils.XLAT(\"fantasy_world_spell_popup_cast_button\"));\n    }\n\n    public void ConfirmSingleSpellMagic()\n    {\n        if (m_SingleCastSpellSelection)\n        {\n            m_SingleCastSpellSelection.OnCastSpell();\n        }\n        else\n        {\n            if (m_SingleCastSpellDialog)\n            {\n                if (m_SingleCastSpellDialog.IsAllianceSkillForbidden())\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.toast.Show(Utils.XLAT(\"toast_fantasy_s7_spell_cast_today_na\"));\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                var fantasyAllianceSkill= m_SingleCastSpellDialog.GetFantasyAllianceSkill();\n                if (fantasyAllianceSkill != null)\n                {\n                    switch (fantasyAllianceSkill.TargetType)\n                    {\n                        case FantasyAllianceSkillInfo.SkillTargetType.HelpAttackCity:\n                        case FantasyAllianceSkillInfo.SkillTargetType.HelpDefenseCity:\n                            UIManager.inst.toast.Show(Utils.XLAT_Extend(\"fantasy_world_s3_wrong_subject\"));\n                            break;\n                        case FantasyAllianceSkillInfo.SkillTargetType.HelpAttackPveCity:\n                            UIManager.inst.toast.Show(Utils.XLAT_Extend(\"toast_trading_route_s5_spell_7_target_wrong\"));\n                            break;\n                        default:\n                            UIManager.inst.toast.Show(fantasyAllianceSkill.TargetDes);\n                            break;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public void ResetTeleport()\n    {\n        m_PVPMapMode = PVPMapMode.Teleport;\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.Normal);\n    }\n\n    public void EnterTeleportMode(Coordinate target, TeleportMode teleportMode, long allianceBuildingId,\n        bool keepTargetInCenter = false, object userData = null)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.Teleport);\n\n        object data = null;\n        switch (teleportMode)\n        {\n            case TeleportMode.PLACE_FORTRESS:\n                data = PlayerData.inst.allianceData;\n                break;\n            case TeleportMode.ALLIANCE_WAR_TELEPORT:\n            case TeleportMode.ALLIANCE_WAR_ENTER_TELEPORT:\n                data = PlayerData.inst.playerCityData;\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = false;\n                break;\n\n            default:\n                data = PlayerData.inst.playerCityData;\n                break;\n        }\n\n        if (userData != null)\n        {\n            data = userData;\n        }\n\n        CurrentKXY = target;\n        GotoLocation(target, false);\n\n        WorldCoordinate worldCoords = _mapData.ConvertTileKXYToWorldCoordinate(target);\n        m_TeleportHighlight.Setup(teleportMode, _mapData, PVPSystem.Instance.Map.Cities, worldCoords,\n            allianceBuildingId, data, keepTargetInCenter);\n\n        var hud = UIManager.inst.publicHUD.CoordinateHud;\n        if (hud)\n        {\n            if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HUDUIVisiable)\n                hud.HideHUD();\n        }\n\n        OnUpdatePvpMapDistanceMarker();\n    }\n\n\n    public void EnterPreviewFortressMode(Coordinate target, TeleportMode teleportMode)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.Teleport);\n\n        CurrentKXY = target;\n        GotoLocation(target, false);\n\n        WorldCoordinate worldCoords = _mapData.ConvertTileKXYToWorldCoordinate(target);\n        m_TeleportHighlight.SetupPreview(teleportMode, _mapData, worldCoords);\n\n        var hud = UIManager.inst.publicHUD.CoordinateHud;\n        if (hud != null)\n        {\n            if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HUDUIVisiable)\n                hud.HideHUD();\n        }\n    }\n\n\n    public void EnterNormalMode()\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.Normal);\n\n        var hud = UIManager.inst.publicHUD.CoordinateHud;\n        if (hud != null)\n        {\n            if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HUDUIVisiable)\n                hud.ShowHUD();\n        }\n    }\n\n    public void EnterPlaceTurretMode(Coordinate target, long internalId, bool keepTargetInCenter = false)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.Turret);\n        CurrentKXY = target;\n        GotoLocation(target, false);\n        m_AllianceTurrentHighlight.Setup(target, internalId, _mapData,\n            PVPSystem.Instance.Map.Cities, keepTargetInCenter);\n\n        var hud = UIManager.inst.publicHUD.CoordinateHud;\n        if (hud != null)\n        {\n            if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HUDUIVisiable)\n                hud.HideHUD();\n        }\n    }\n\n\n    public void EnterPreviewTurretMode(Coordinate target, bool keepTargetInCenter = false)\n    {\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.Turret);\n        CurrentKXY = target;\n        GotoLocation(target, false);\n\n        m_AllianceTurrentHighlight.SetupPreview(_mapData.ConvertTileKXYToWorldCoordinate(target), _mapData,\n            PVPSystem.Instance.Map.Cities, keepTargetInCenter);\n\n        var hud = UIManager.inst.publicHUD.CoordinateHud;\n        if (hud != null)\n        {\n            if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HUDUIVisiable)\n                hud.HideHUD();\n        }\n    }\n\n    public void EnterPlaceAllianceWarMineMode(Coordinate target, long buildingInfoInternalId,\n        bool keepTargetInCenter = false)\n    {\n        TeleportManager.Instance.SetTeleportMode(TeleportMode.PLACE_ALLIANCE_WAR_MINE);\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.TeleportCombination);\n        CurrentKXY = target;\n        GotoLocation(target, false);\n        TeleportValueGroup.TeleportCombinationParam teleportCombinationParam =\n            new TeleportValueGroup.TeleportCombinationParam\n            {\n                TeleportMode = TeleportMode.PLACE_ALLIANCE_WAR_MINE,\n                ConfigId = buildingInfoInternalId,\n                PrefabName = TeleportValueGroup.GetAllianceWarMinePrefab(),\n                PrefabScale = 0.7f,\n                BtnSets = TeleportCombinationManager.Instance.TeleportBtnSets.AllianceWarMine,\n                BtnNames = TeleportCombinationManager.Instance.TeleportBtnNames.AllianceWarMine,\n                Desc = Utils.XLAT(\"alliance_war_mine_storage_area_cannot_place\"),\n                BtnCallbacks = TeleportCombinationManager.Instance.TeleportBtnDelegateSets.AllianceWarMine,\n                MainCheckCanPut = TeleportCombinationManager.Instance.TeleportCheckingDelegateSets.AllianceWarMine[0],\n                SubCheckCanPut = TeleportCombinationManager.Instance.TeleportCheckingDelegateSets.AllianceWarMine[0],\n//            SubCheckCanPut =\n//                TeleportCombinationManager.Instance.TeleportCheckingDelegateSets.AllianceWarMine.Count >\n//                1 ? TeleportCombinationManager.Instance.TeleportCheckingDelegateSets.AllianceWarMine[1] :\n//                    TeleportCombinationManager.Instance.TeleportCheckingDelegateSets.AllianceWarMine[0],\n                BuildingPostProcess =\n                    TeleportCombinationManager.Instance.TeleportBuildingPostProcessSets.AllianceWarMine,\n            };\n        _teleportCombinationHighLight.Setup(teleportCombinationParam, target, _mapData,\n            PVPSystem.Instance.Map.Cities, keepTargetInCenter);\n\n        var hud = UIManager.inst.publicHUD.CoordinateHud;\n        if (hud != null)\n        {\n            if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HUDUIVisiable)\n                hud.HideHUD();\n        }\n    }\n\n    //探索模式\n    public void EnterKingdomMapExploreMode(Coordinate target, Coordinate exploreCoordinate,\n        bool keepTargetInCenter = false)\n    {\n        TeleportManager.Instance.SetTeleportMode(TeleportMode.ENTER_EXPLORE);\n        SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode.Explore);\n        CurrentKXY = target;\n        GotoLocation(target, false);\n\n        TeleportValueGroup.TeleportKingdomExploreParam teleportCombinationParam =\n            new TeleportValueGroup.TeleportKingdomExploreParam\n            {\n                TeleportMode = TeleportMode.ENTER_EXPLORE,\n                ExploreCoordinator = exploreCoordinate,\n                CheckCanExplore = TeleportCheckExploreLogicGroup.CanExploreAt,\n            };\n        //设置探索预览 地块高亮\n        if (_teleportKingdomExploreHighLight)\n            _teleportKingdomExploreHighLight.Setup(teleportCombinationParam, target, _mapData,\n                PVPSystem.Instance.Map.Cities, keepTargetInCenter);\n\n        var hud = UIManager.inst.publicHUD.CoordinateHud;\n        if (hud)\n        {\n            if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HUDUIVisiable)\n                hud.HideHUD();\n        }\n\n        //更新占卜 雷达\n        OnUpdateKingdomExploreMarker();\n        //更新距离\n        OnUpdatePvpMapDistanceMarker();\n    }\n\n    void SubmitModeChangedMsg(PVPMapMode pvpMapMode)\n    {\n        if (null != this && Fortress)\n        {\n            foreach (Transform child in Fortress)\n            {\n                if(child == null)\n                    continue;\n\n                if (!child.gameObject.activeInHierarchy)\n                    continue;\n\n                var msgReceiver = child.GetComponent<IReceiveMsgController>();\n                if (null != msgReceiver)\n                {\n                    msgReceiver.SubmitMsg(pvpMapMode);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        HashSet<string> famousCityModelNames = ConfigManager2.Instance.DB_TerritoryCity?.AllModelNames ?? null;\n        if (null != this && transform && famousCityModelNames != null)\n        {\n            foreach (Transform child in transform)\n            {\n                if (child == null)\n                    continue;\n\n                if (!famousCityModelNames.Contains(child.name))\n                    continue;\n\n                var msgReceiver = child.GetComponent<IReceiveMsgController>();\n                msgReceiver?.SubmitMsg(pvpMapMode);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    void ResetPVPMapMode()\n    {\n        switch (m_PVPMapMode)\n        {\n            case PVPMapMode.Teleport:\n            case PVPMapMode.Normal:\n\n                if (m_TeleportHighlight != null && m_TeleportHighlight.gameObject && m_TeleportHighlight.CanDestroy)\n                {\n                    Destroy(m_TeleportHighlight.gameObject);\n                }\n\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.DestroyTeleport();\n\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.DestroyAggress(true);\n\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n\n                TeleportMode tmpTeleportMode = m_TeleportHighlight != null\n                    ? m_TeleportHighlight.GetTeleportMode()\n                    : TeleportMode.ADVANCE_TELEPORT;\n                if (tmpTeleportMode == TeleportMode.ALLIANCE_WAR_BACK_TELEPORT\n                    || tmpTeleportMode == TeleportMode.ALLIANCE_WAR_ENTER_TELEPORT\n                    || tmpTeleportMode == TeleportMode.ALLIANCE_WAR_TELEPORT)\n                {\n                    if (m_TeleportHighlight != null && !m_TeleportHighlight.CanDestroy)\n                    {\n                        if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                            UIManager.inst.DisableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        if (tmpTeleportMode == TeleportMode.ALLIANCE_WAR_ENTER_TELEPORT)\n                        {\n                            UIHideHelperManager.Instance.BackToOriginal();\n                        }\n\n                        if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                            UIManager.inst.EnableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n                    }\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                        UIManager.inst.EnableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n                }\n\n                break;\n            case PVPMapMode.Turret:\n                if (m_AllianceTurrentHighlight.gameObject)\n                {\n                    Destroy(m_AllianceTurrentHighlight.gameObject);\n                }\n\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.DestroyTurret(true);\n                }\n\n\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.DestroyAggress(true);\n\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n\n                if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                    UIManager.inst.EnableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n\n                break;\n\n            case PVPMapMode.FantasyTowerTurret:\n                ResetFantasyWorldTowerMode();\n                break;\n            case PVPMapMode.FantasySummonRuin:\n                ResetFantasySummonRuins();\n                break;\n\n            case PVPMapMode.TeleportCombination:\n                if (_teleportCombinationHighLight.gameObject)\n                {\n                    Destroy(_teleportCombinationHighLight.gameObject);\n                }\n\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.DestroyTeleportCombination(true);\n                }\n\n\n                //UIManager.inst.publicHUD.DestroyAggress(true);\n\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n\n                if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                    UIManager.inst.EnableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n\n                break;\n            case PVPMapMode.Explore:\n                if (_teleportKingdomExploreHighLight != null && _teleportKingdomExploreHighLight.gameObject)\n                {\n                    Destroy(_teleportKingdomExploreHighLight.gameObject);\n                }\n\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.DestroyTeleportKingdomExplore();\n                }\n\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n                if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                    UIManager.inst.EnableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n\n                break;\n            case PVPMapMode.MultipleSpell:\n                if (m_SingleCastSpellDialog)\n                {\n                    Destroy(m_SingleCastSpellDialog.gameObject);\n                    m_SingleCastSpellDialog = null;\n                }\n\n                if (m_SpellRangeHighlight)\n                {\n                    m_SpellRangeHighlight.ClearSelectedTiles();\n                    Destroy(m_SpellRangeHighlight.gameObject);\n                    m_SpellRangeHighlight = null;\n                }\n\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD)\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.ExitSelectTargetMode();\n                }\n\n                UIManager.inst.ShowTimerHud();\n                break;\n\n            case PVPMapMode.SingleSpell:\n                if (m_SingleCastSpellDialog)\n                {\n                    Destroy(m_SingleCastSpellDialog.gameObject);\n                    m_SingleCastSpellDialog = null;\n                }\n\n                if (m_SingleCastSpellSelection)\n                {\n                    Destroy(m_SingleCastSpellSelection.gameObject);\n                    m_SingleCastSpellSelection = null;\n                }\n\n                if (_previousSpellTileData != null)\n                {\n                    _previousSpellTileData.CurrentSpellAbleState = TileData.SpellAbleState.SpellAbleNone;\n                    _previousSpellTileData = null;\n                }\n\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD)\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.ExitSelectTargetMode();\n                }\n\n                UIManager.inst.ShowTimerHud();\n                break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    void SetPVPMapMode(PVPMapMode pvpMapMode)\n    {\n        TileCamera.Instance.EnablePinch = true;\n        // exit\n        ResetPVPMapMode();\n\n        m_PVPMapMode = pvpMapMode;\n        // enter\n        switch (m_PVPMapMode)\n        {\n            case PVPMapMode.Teleport:\n            { \n#if TELEPORT_LITE\n                GameObject go =\n                    AssetManagerEx.Instance.LoadWithAutoRelease(\"Prefab/Kingdom/TELEPORT_HIGHLIGHT_LITE\") as\n                        GameObject;\n\n#else\nGameObject go =\n                    FunPlus.AssetManager.AssetManagerEx.Instance.LoadWithAutoRelease(\"Prefab/Kingdom/TELEPORT_HIGHLIGHT\") as\n                        GameObject;\n#endif\n\n                go = Instantiate(go);\n\n                if (m_TeleportHighlight != null)\n                {\n                    Destroy(m_TeleportHighlight.gameObject);\n                }\n\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.DestroyTeleport(true);\n\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.DestroyAggress(true);\n\n#if TELEPORT_LITE\n                m_TeleportHighlight = go.GetComponent<TeleportHighlightLite>();\n#else\n                m_TeleportHighlight = go.GetComponent<TeleportHighlight>();\n\n#endif\n                m_TeleportHighlight.InitCamera();\n                m_TeleportHighlight.transform.parent = gameObject.transform;\n                //TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = false;\n                //TODO: 传送, 传送移动地图，而不移动城堡\n                //m_TileCamera.EnableDragging = false;\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n                m_TeleportHighlight.StopDragging();\n#if !TELEPORT_LITE\n                m_TeleportHighlight.OnCancel = OnCancelTeleport;\n                m_TeleportHighlight.OnConfirm = OnConfirmTeleport;\n#endif\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.TeleportPart.OnCancel = OnCancelTeleport;\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.TeleportPart.OnConfirm = OnConfirmTeleport;\n                }\n\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.AggressPart.OnCancel = OnCancelTeleport;\n\n                if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                    UIManager.inst.DisableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n\n                HideHighlight();\n\n                TeleportMode tmpTeleportMode = m_TeleportHighlight != null\n                    ? m_TeleportHighlight.GetTeleportMode()\n                    : TeleportMode.ADVANCE_TELEPORT;\n                if (tmpTeleportMode == TeleportMode.ADVANCE_TELEPORT)\n                {\n                    TileCamera.Instance.EnablePinch = false;\n                }\n\n                break;\n            }\n            case PVPMapMode.Turret:\n            {\n#if TELEPORT_LITE\n                GameObject go =\n                    AssetManagerEx.Instance.LoadWithAutoRelease(\"Prefab/Kingdom/ALLIANCE_TURRET_LITE\") as \n                        GameObject;\n#else\n GameObject go =\n                    FunPlus.AssetManager.AssetManagerEx.Instance.LoadWithAutoRelease(\"Prefab/Kingdom/ALLIANCE_TURRET\") as GameObject;\n#endif\n                go = Instantiate(go);\n#if TELEPORT_LITE\n                m_AllianceTurrentHighlight = go.GetComponent<AllianceTurretHighlightLite>();\n#else\n                m_AllianceTurrentHighlight = go.GetComponent<AllianceTurretHighlight>();\n#endif\n\n                m_AllianceTurrentHighlight.InitCamera();\n                var transform1 = m_AllianceTurrentHighlight.transform;\n                transform1.parent = gameObject.transform;\n                transform1.localScale = Vector3.one;\n                //TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = false;\n                //建造哨塔也需要拖动\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n                m_AllianceTurrentHighlight.StopDragging();\n\n#if !TELEPORT_LITE\n                m_AllianceTurrentHighlight.OnCancel = OnCancelTeleport;\n                m_AllianceTurrentHighlight.OnConfirm = OnConfirmTeleport;\n#endif\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.TurretPart.OnCancel = OnCancelTeleport;\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.TurretPart.OnConfirm = OnConfirmTeleport;\n                }\n\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.AggressPart.OnCancel = OnCancelTeleport;\n\n                if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                    UIManager.inst.DisableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n                HideHighlight();\n                break;\n            }\n            case PVPMapMode.TeleportCombination:\n            {\n                GameObject go =\n                    AssetManagerEx.Instance.LoadWithAutoRelease(\"Prefab/Kingdom/TELEPORT_COMBINATION_HIGH_LIGHT\") as\n                        GameObject;\n\n                go = Instantiate(go);\n\n                _teleportCombinationHighLight = go.GetComponent<TELEPORT_COMBINATION_HIGH_LIGHT>();\n\n\n                _teleportCombinationHighLight.InitCamera();\n                var transform1 = _teleportCombinationHighLight.transform;\n                transform1.parent = gameObject.transform;\n                transform1.localScale = Vector3.one;\n\n                //建造哨塔也需要拖动\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n                _teleportCombinationHighLight.StopDragging();\n\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.AggressPart.OnCancel = OnCancelTeleport;\n\n                if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                    UIManager.inst.DisableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n                HideHighlight();\n                break;\n            }\n            case PVPMapMode.Explore: //探索  \n            {\n                GameObject go =\n                    AssetManagerEx.Instance.LoadWithAutoRelease(\"Prefab/Kingdom/TELEPORT_KINGDOMEXPLORE_HIGH_LIGHT\") as\n                        GameObject;\n                go = Instantiate(go);\n                _teleportKingdomExploreHighLight = go.GetComponent<TELEPORT_KINGDOMEXPLORE_HIGH_LIGHT>();\n                if (_teleportKingdomExploreHighLight)\n                    _teleportKingdomExploreHighLight.InitCamera();\n\n                var transform1 = _teleportKingdomExploreHighLight.transform;\n                transform1.parent = gameObject.transform;\n                transform1.localScale = Vector3.one;\n\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n                if (_teleportKingdomExploreHighLight)\n                    _teleportKingdomExploreHighLight.StopDragging();\n\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.KingdomExplorePart.OnCancelClick = OnCancelTeleport;\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.KingdomExplorePart.OnConfirmClick = OnConfirmTeleport;\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.KingdomExplorePart.OnHideExploreHighLight = OnHideExploreHighLight;\n\n                if (!UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HasTeleport)\n                    UIManager.inst.DisableUI2DTouchAndMouse();\n                HideHighlight();\n                break;\n            }\n            case PVPMapMode.MultipleSpell:\n            {\n                GameObject go;\n\n                go = AssetManagerEx.Instance.LoadWithAutoRelease(\"Prefab/Kingdom/SINGLE_CAST_SPELL\") as\n                    GameObject;\n                go = Instantiate(go);\n                m_SingleCastSpellDialog = go.GetComponent<SingleCastSpellDialog>();\n                var transform1 = m_SingleCastSpellDialog.transform;\n                transform1.parent = UIManager.inst.ui2DCamera.transform;\n                transform1.localPosition = Vector3.zero;\n                transform1.localScale = Vector3.one;\n\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.CreateSpellAllianceMagicPart(PVPSystem.Instance.Map.ConfirmMultipleSpellMagic);\n\n                go = AssetManagerEx.Instance.LoadWithAutoRelease(\"Prefab/Kingdom/SPELL_RANGE\") as GameObject;\n                go = Instantiate(go);\n                m_SpellRangeHighlight = go.GetComponent<SpellRangeHighlight>();\n                var transform2 = m_SpellRangeHighlight.transform;\n                transform2.parent = gameObject.transform;\n                transform2.localScale = Vector3.one;\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n                m_SpellRangeHighlight.StopDragging();\n                m_SpellRangeHighlight.OnCancel = OnCancelTeleport;\n                m_SpellRangeHighlight.OnConfirm = OnConfirmTeleport;\n                m_SpellRangeHighlight.Init();\n\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD)\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.EnterSelectTargetMode();\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HideQuickSelectPosPart();\n                }\n\n                UIManager.inst.HideTimerHud();\n                HideHighlight();\n                break;\n            }\n            case PVPMapMode.SingleSpell:\n            {\n                GameObject go = AssetManagerEx.Instance.LoadWithAutoRelease(\"Prefab/Kingdom/SINGLE_CAST_SPELL\") as GameObject;\n                go = Instantiate(go);\n                m_SingleCastSpellDialog = go.GetComponent<SingleCastSpellDialog>();\n                var transform1 = m_SingleCastSpellDialog.transform;\n                transform1.parent = UIManager.inst.ui2DCamera.transform;\n                transform1.localPosition = Vector3.zero;\n                transform1.localScale = Vector3.one;\n\n                UIManager.inst.publicHUD.CreateSpellAllianceMagicPart(PVPSystem.Instance.Map.ConfirmSingleSpellMagic);\n\n                TileCamera.Instance.enableDragging = true;\n\n                if (UIManager.inst.publicHUD)\n                {\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.EnterSelectTargetMode();\n                    UIManager.inst.publicHUD.HideQuickSelectPosPart();\n                }\n\n                UIManager.inst.HideTimerHud();\n                HideHighlight();\n                break;\n            }\n            case PVPMapMode.FantasyTowerTurret:\n                StartShowFantasyWorldTower();\n                break;\n            case PVPMapMode.FantasySummonRuin:\n                StartShowFantasySummonRuins();\n                break;\n        }\n\n        MessageBroker.Default.Publish(new SwitchMapTeleportModeEvt { switchPVPMapMode = m_PVPMapMode });\n\n        SubmitModeChangedMsg(m_PVPMapMode);\n    }\n\n    void OnCancelTeleport()\n    {\n        EnterNormalMode();\n    }\n\n    void OnConfirmTeleport(Coordinate target)\n    {\n        EnterNormalMode();\n    }\n\n    void OnConfirmTeleport(object target)\n    {\n        EnterNormalMode();\n    }\n\n    void OnHideExploreHighLight()\n    {\n        if (_teleportKingdomExploreHighLight != null && _teleportKingdomExploreHighLight.gameObject)\n        {\n            Destroy(_teleportKingdomExploreHighLight.gameObject);\n            _teleportKingdomExploreHighLight = null;\n        }\n    }\n\n\n    void RegisterListeners()\n    {\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_Alliance.onDataChanged += OnAllianceDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_AllianceBuilding.OnDataChanged += OnAllianceBuildingDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_User.onDataChanged += OnUserDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_City.onDataChanged += OnUserCityChanged;\n        AllianceManager.Instance.onJoin += OnJoinAllianceEvent;\n        AllianceManager.Instance.onLeave += OnLeaveAllianceEvent;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_AllianceBookmark.onDataChanged += OnAllianceBookmarkDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_AllianceBookmark.onDataRemove += OnAllianceBookmarkRemoved;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_WarZoneBookmark.onDataChanged += OnWarZoneBookmarkDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_WarZoneBookmark.onDataRemove += OnWarZoneBookmarkDataRemoved;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_FantasyS7GuildBookmarkDB.onDataChanged += OnFantasyS7GuildBookmarkDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_FantasyS7GuildBookmarkDB.onDataRemove += OnFantasyS7GuildBookmarkDataRemoved;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_LostBattleFieldBookmark.onDataChanged += OnLostBattleFieldBookmarkDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_LostBattleFieldBookmark.onDataRemove += OnLostBattleFieldBookmarkDataRemoved;\n        \n        _mapData.OnEnterKingdomBlock += OnEnterKingdomBlock;\n        MessageBroker.Default.Receive<TerritoryFamousCityMarkUpdateEvt>().Subscribe(_ => { OnUpdateFamousCityMark(); })\n            .AddTo(_disposables);\n\n        Oscillator.Instance.threeSecondEvent += OnThreeSecondTick;\n        //InitFantasyWorld();\n    }\n\n    void Dispose()\n    {\n        if (_buildingZoneView != null)\n            _buildingZoneView.DestroyLine();\n\n        PendingGotoRequest = new Coordinate();\n    }\n\n    void UnregisterListeners()\n    {\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_Alliance.onDataChanged -= OnAllianceDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_AllianceBuilding.OnDataChanged -= OnAllianceBuildingDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_User.onDataChanged -= OnUserDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_City.onDataChanged -= OnUserCityChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_AllianceBookmark.onDataChanged -= OnAllianceBookmarkDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_AllianceBookmark.onDataRemove -= OnAllianceBookmarkRemoved;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_WarZoneBookmark.onDataChanged -= OnWarZoneBookmarkDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_WarZoneBookmark.onDataRemove -= OnWarZoneBookmarkDataRemoved;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_FantasyS7GuildBookmarkDB.onDataChanged -= OnFantasyS7GuildBookmarkDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_FantasyS7GuildBookmarkDB.onDataRemove -= OnFantasyS7GuildBookmarkDataRemoved;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_LostBattleFieldBookmark.onDataChanged -= OnLostBattleFieldBookmarkDataChanged;\n        DBManager.Instance.DB_LostBattleFieldBookmark.onDataRemove -= OnLostBattleFieldBookmarkDataRemoved;\n\n        AllianceManager.Instance.onJoin -= OnJoinAllianceEvent;\n        AllianceManager.Instance.onLeave -= OnLeaveAllianceEvent;\n        _mapData.OnEnterKingdomBlock -= OnEnterKingdomBlock;\n        \n        Oscillator.Instance.threeSecondEvent -= OnThreeSecondTick;\n\n\n        if (_disposables != null)\n        {\n            _disposables.Clear();\n            _disposables = null;\n        }\n\n        //DisposeAllianceMarks();\n        //_allianceMarkGos = null;\n        //DisposeFantasyWorld();\n\n        DisposeAllBookmarkGos();\n        _bookMarkGos = null;\n\n    }\n\n    void OnEnterKingdomBlock()\n    {\n        Coordinate kxy = _mapData.ConvertPixelPositionToTileKXY(_lastTarget);\n        Coordinate blockOrigin = BlockData.CalculateBlockOrigin(kxy, _mapData);\n        if (DBManager.Instance != null)\n        {\n            DBManager.Instance.DB_March.ClearThirdPartMarch(blockOrigin.X, blockOrigin.Y);\n        }\n\n        if (_isToOpenCityCircle)\n        {\n            DoOpenMyCityTouchCircle();\n        }\n\n        OnUpdateAllianceMarks(WORLD_MARK_UPDATE_TYPE.FIRST_ENTTER_KINGDOWM);\n        OnUpdateWarZoneMarks(WORLD_MARK_UPDATE_TYPE.FIRST_ENTTER_KINGDOWM);\n        OnUpdateFantasyS7GuildMarks(WORLD_MARK_UPDATE_TYPE.FIRST_ENTTER_KINGDOWM);\n        OnUpdateLostBattleFieldZoneMarks( WORLD_MARK_UPDATE_TYPE.FIRST_ENTTER_KINGDOWM);\n\n        OnUpdateFamousCityMark();\n        OnUpdatePvpMapDistanceMarker();\n        OnUpdateAllianceMineDistanceMarker();\n        OnUpdateAllianceBookMarkDistanceMarker();\n\n        _dragCount++;\n    }\n\n\n    private bool _allianceDataChanged;\n\n    public void OnJoinAllianceEvent()\n    {\n    }\n\n    public void OnLeaveAllianceEvent()\n    {\n        OnUpdateAllianceMarks(WORLD_MARK_UPDATE_TYPE.ALLIANCE_LEAVE_EVENT);\n        OnUpdateWarZoneMarks(WORLD_MARK_UPDATE_TYPE.ALLIANCE_LEAVE_EVENT);\n        OnUpdateLostBattleFieldZoneMarks( WORLD_MARK_UPDATE_TYPE.ALLIANCE_LEAVE_EVENT);\n    }\n\n    void OnAllianceDataChanged(long allianceId)\n    {\n        _allianceDataChanged = true;\n    }\n\n    void OnAllianceBuildingDataChanged(AllianceBuildingData building)\n    {\n        _allianceDataChanged = true;\n    }\n\n\n    void OnUserDataChanged(long uid)\n    {\n        _allianceDataChanged = true;\n    }\n\n    void OnUserCityChanged(long cityId)\n    {\n        _allianceDataChanged = true;\n        OnUpdatePvpMapDistanceMarker();\n    }\n\n\n    public void Setup(DynamicMapData mapData)\n    {\n        _mapData = mapData;\n\n        TileMapScale = GameEngine.Instance.tileMapScale;\n        InverseTileMapScale = 1 / TileMapScale;\n\n        SetupCamera();\n        RegisterListeners();\n\n        SetupDecoration();\n\n        // _colorMeshHelper = this.GetComponentInChildren<ColorMeshHelper>();\n    }\n\n    public void Shutdown()\n    {\n        ShutDownDecoration();\n        \n        _dragCount = 0;\n        ShutdownCamera();\n        UnregisterListeners();\n\n        Dispose();\n    }\n\n    public void UpdateCameraBoundary()\n    {\n        Rect boundary = _mapData.WorldDimension;\n        if (PlayerData.inst.IsInAlliance1v1)\n        {\n            //虚空联赛，把镜头边界限制，缩小到1个王国（之前是全部王国），防止移动出国，解决发兵加速坐标错乱(加速时不在限制跨国，已确保坐标正确；平时防止拖拽跨国用这个boundary)。\n            WorldCoordinate worldCoordinate =\n                _mapData.GetKingdomOriginWorldCoordinate(PlayerData.inst.CityData.Location.K);\n            boundary = new Rect(worldCoordinate.X, worldCoordinate.Y - 1, 1, 1);\n            boundary.xMin = boundary.xMin * _mapData.PixelsPerKingdom.x + 0.5f * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.x;\n            boundary.xMax = boundary.xMax * _mapData.PixelsPerKingdom.x - 0.5f * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.x;\n            boundary.yMin = boundary.yMin * _mapData.PixelsPerKingdom.y + 0.5f * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.y;\n            boundary.yMax = boundary.yMax * _mapData.PixelsPerKingdom.y - 0.5f * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.y;\n            boundary.xMin *= TileMapScale;\n            boundary.xMax *= TileMapScale;\n            boundary.yMin *= TileMapScale;\n            boundary.yMax *= TileMapScale;\n        }\n        else\n        {\n            boundary.xMin = boundary.xMin * _mapData.PixelsPerKingdom.x + 0.5f * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.x;\n            boundary.xMax = boundary.xMax * _mapData.PixelsPerKingdom.x - 0.5f * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.x;\n            boundary.yMin = boundary.yMin * _mapData.PixelsPerKingdom.y + 0.5f * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.y;\n            boundary.yMax = boundary.yMax * _mapData.PixelsPerKingdom.y - 0.5f * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.y;\n            boundary.xMin *= TileMapScale;\n            boundary.xMax *= TileMapScale;\n            boundary.yMin *= TileMapScale;\n            boundary.yMax *= TileMapScale;\n        }\n\n        D.Log(\"[InitCamera]boundary = {0}\", boundary);\n\n        TileCamera.Instance.boundary = boundary;\n    }\n\n    private void SetupCamera()\n    {\n        if (UIManager.inst)\n        {\n            if (TileCamera.Instance)\n            {\n                transform.localScale = new Vector3(TileMapScale, TileMapScale, TileMapScale);\n\n                UpdateCameraBoundary();\n                TileCamera.Instance.SetIsAlliance1v1(PlayerData.inst.IsInAlliance1v1);\n                TileCamera.Instance.onZoom += OnZoom;\n                TileCamera.Instance.onTap += OnTap;\n                TileCamera.Instance.onDrag += OnDrag;\n\n                //策划不要了\n#if false\n                if (GraphicsLevel.Value > EGraphicsLevel.Low)\n                {\n                    var fogPrefab = AssetManager.Instance.Load(\"Prefab/VFX/cam_fog\");\n                    if (fogPrefab != null)\n                    {\n                        _fogGo = Instantiate(fogPrefab, TileCamera.Instance.transform) as GameObject;\n\n                        var z = TileCamera.Instance.Camera.nearClipPlane + 0.01f; \n                        Vector3[] outCorners = new Vector3[4];\n                        TileCamera.Instance.Camera.CalculateFrustumCorners(\n                            new Rect(0,0,1,1), z,\n                            Camera.MonoOrStereoscopicEye.Mono, outCorners);\n\n                        var transform1 = TileCamera.Instance.Camera.transform;\n                        var pos = transform1.position + transform1.forward * z;\n                        _fogGo.transform.position = pos;\n                        _fogGo.transform.localRotation = Quaternion.identity;\n                        \n                        var r = _fogGo.GetComponentInChildren<SpriteRenderer>();\n                        var size = r.size;\n                        var localScale = new Vector3( 1/size.x * (outCorners[2] - outCorners[1]).magnitude,\n                            1/size.y * (outCorners[1] - outCorners[0]).magnitude, 1f);\n\n                        var lossyScale = _fogGo.transform.parent.lossyScale;\n                        localScale.x /= lossyScale.x;\n                        localScale.y /= lossyScale.y;\n                        localScale.z /= lossyScale.z;\n                        _fogGo.transform.localScale = localScale;\n                    }\n                }\n#endif\n\n                if (XTutorialMgr.Instance.HasActivatedStep() && XTutorialMgr.Instance.InWorldTrend)\n                {\n                    var cam = TileCamera.Instance;\n                    if (cam != null)\n                    {\n                        cam.SetAutoZoomForWorldTrend();\n                    }\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    TileCamera.Instance.ResetAutoZoomZone();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private void ShutdownCamera()\n    {\n        if (TileCamera.Instance)\n        {\n            TileCamera.Instance.onZoom -= OnZoom;\n            TileCamera.Instance.onTap -= OnTap;\n            TileCamera.Instance.onDrag -= OnDrag;\n            TileCamera.Instance.EnableAutoZooming = false;\n\n            if (_fogGo)\n            {\n                Destroy(_fogGo);\n                _fogGo = null;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    void OnZoom()\n    {\n        //Viewport = GetClipViewport();\n        //_mapData.UpdateViewport(Viewport);\n        //ForceUpdate = true;\n    }\n\n    Rect ConvertCameraViewport2MapArea(Rect viewport)\n    {\n        Rect area = new Rect();\n\n        float scale = 1f / transform.localScale.x;\n        area.xMin = viewport.xMin * scale;\n        area.xMax = viewport.xMax * scale;\n        area.yMin = viewport.yMin * scale;\n        area.yMax = viewport.yMax * scale;\n\n        return area;\n    }\n    \n    void OnThreeSecondTick(int deltaTime)\n    {\n        if (_allianceDataChanged && TileCamera.IsAvailable() && TileCamera.Instance.IsIdle)\n        {\n            _allianceDataChanged = false;\n            _mapData?.UpdateView();\n        }\n    }\n\n    public void ForeachCullingTile(Action<TileData> cb)\n    {\n        _mapData.ForeachCullingTile(cb);\n    }\n\n    // 副本服只刷单个服，没有周边服，忽略刷新避免拖出边界\n    bool IgnoreUpdateByChangedK(Coordinate kxy)\n    {\n        bool ignoreUpdate = false;\n\n        if (kxy.K != CurrentKXY.K)\n        {\n            ignoreUpdate =\n                MapUtils.IsPitWorld(CurrentKXY.K) ||\n                MapUtils.IsWarZoneWorld(CurrentKXY.K) ||\n                MapUtils.IsLostBattleFieldWorld(CurrentKXY.K);\n        }\n\n        return ignoreUpdate;\n    }\n    \n    \n    \n    WorldCoordinate lookAtCoord = new WorldCoordinate(0,0);\n    Coordinate newCoordinate = Coordinate.zero;\n\n    private bool _isViewMoving = false;\n    void LateUpdate()\n    {\n        _isViewMoving = false;\n        \n        if (!TileCamera.IsAvailable() || !GameEngine.IsAvailable || GameEngine.IsShuttingDown)\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (_mapData.IsKingdomActive(PendingGotoRequest.K))\n        {\n            DoNotHideHighlight_GotoLocation(PendingGotoRequest, false, EnumCheckType.ENone);\n            PendingGotoRequest.K = 0;\n            PendingGotoRequest.X = 0;\n            PendingGotoRequest.Y = 0;\n        }\n\n        OnUpdateFamousCityMark();\n        OnUpdateSeasonWallMarker();\n\n        bool viewportChanged = false;\n        Rect viewport = CalcViewport();\n        if (_viewport != viewport)\n        {\n            _isViewMoving = true;\n            var lt = _mapData.ConvertPixelPositionToWorldCoordinate(new Vector2(viewport.min.x, viewport.max.y));\n            var rd = _mapData.ConvertPixelPositionToWorldCoordinate(new Vector2(viewport.max.x, viewport.min.y));\n            if (_ltWorldCoord != lt || _rdWorldCoord != rd)\n            {\n                _ltWorldCoord = lt;\n                _rdWorldCoord = rd;\n                viewportChanged = true;\n            }\n        }\n\n        //if (ForceUpdate)\n        //{\n        //    _mapData.ForceUpdate();\n        //    ForceUpdate = false;\n        //}\n\n        if (viewportChanged || ForceUpdate)\n        {\n            ForceUpdate = false;\n            _viewport = CalcViewport();\n\n\n            if (MapUtils.IsWarZoneWorld(CurrentKXY.K) && TileCamera.Instance.ViewPortUpdated)\n            {    \n                //战区block面积比较小，因此使用viewport coners计算的的中心点\n                Vector2 lookAtPosition = TileCamera.Instance.GetViewPortCenterPosition();\n                lookAtPosition = lookAtPosition * InverseTileMapScale;\n                lookAtCoord = _mapData.ConvertPixelPositionToWorldCoordinate(lookAtPosition);\n                newCoordinate = _mapData.ConvertWorldCoordinateToKXY(lookAtCoord);\n#if UNITY_EDITOR && TEST_ENABLED\n                \n                D.Log($\"#LOOKAT# view at {lookAtPosition} {lookAtCoord} {newCoordinate}\");\n#endif\n                _mapData.UpdateCenter(lookAtCoord,TileCamera.Instance.NinePixelPoint);\n                \n                //上面的block用viewport中心点刷，下面还得变回相机视线焦点，用于显示坐标（防止和老逻辑冲突）\n                lookAtPosition = TileCamera.Instance.GetLookAtPosition();\n                lookAtPosition = lookAtPosition * InverseTileMapScale;\n                lookAtCoord = _mapData.ConvertPixelPositionToWorldCoordinate(lookAtPosition);\n                newCoordinate = _mapData.ConvertWorldCoordinateToKXY(lookAtCoord);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                \n                Vector2 lookAtPosition = TileCamera.Instance.GetLookAtPosition();\n                lookAtPosition = lookAtPosition * InverseTileMapScale;\n                lookAtCoord = _mapData.ConvertPixelPositionToWorldCoordinate(lookAtPosition);\n                newCoordinate = _mapData.ConvertWorldCoordinateToKXY(lookAtCoord);\n#if UNITY_EDITOR && TEST_ENABLED\n                \n                D.Log($\"#LOOKAT# view at {lookAtPosition} {lookAtCoord} {newCoordinate}\");\n#endif\n                _mapData.UpdateCenter(lookAtCoord);\n                \n            }\n            \n            _mapData.UpdateViewport();\n            if (IsFantasyS18())\n            {\n                _mapData.CullAndShowEx();\n\n            }else if (BattleRoyaleVisionManager.IsBattleRoyaleMode)\n            {\n                _mapData.CullAndShowBattleRoyale();\n            }else\n            {\n                _mapData.CullAndShow();\n            }\n            if (IgnoreUpdateByChangedK(newCoordinate))\n                return;\n\n            Coordinate lastLocation = CurrentKXY;\n            CurrentKXY = newCoordinate;\n\n            if (CurrentKXY.K != lastLocation.K && lastLocation.K != 0)\n            {\n#if UNITY_EDITOR && DEBUG_LOG\n                D.Log(Color.blue,string.Format(\"_currentKXY={0}{1},lastLocation={2}{3}\",CurrentKXY.K,CurrentKXY,lastLocation.K,lastLocation));\n#endif\n\n                if (PlayerData.inst.IsInAlliance1v1)\n                {\n                    //CurrentKXY = lastLocation;\n#if UNITY_EDITOR && DEBUG_LOG\n                    D.Log(Color.red,string.Format(\"Setting K = {0}\",CurrentKXY.K));\n#endif\n                }\n\n                _lastKingdomId = lastLocation.K;\n            }\n\n            UIManager.inst.publicHUD.UpdateKingdomCoordinate(CurrentKXY, lastLocation);\n            _lastTarget = Viewport.center;\n\n            //第一次进入的时候，记录位置\n            //if (OpeningPlayEndAnim_MoGanNa.Instance)\n            //{\n            //    OpeningPlayEndAnim_MoGanNa.Instance.Init(_lastTarget.x, _lastTarget.y);\n            //}\n        }\n\n        //if (ForceUpdate)\n        //{\n        //    _mapData.ForceUpdate();\n        //    ForceUpdate = false;\n        //}\n\n        if (ForceSync)\n        {\n            _mapData.SendUsedBlockEnterKingdomMsg();\n            ForceSync = false;\n        }\n\n        if (PVPSystem.Instance.IsAvailable && _mapData.IsLoaded && ShowCircle)\n        {\n            ShowCircle = false;\n            SyncCurrentXYZToCache();\n            ShowCircleAt(CircleLocation);\n        }\n    }\n\n    private Rect _viewport;\n\n    public Rect Viewport\n    {\n        get { return _viewport; }\n    }\n\n    private WorldCoordinate _ltWorldCoord;\n    private WorldCoordinate _rdWorldCoord;\n\n    Rect CalcViewport()\n    {\n        var viewport = TileCamera.Instance.GetViewport();\n        viewport = ConvertCameraViewport2MapArea(viewport);\n        return viewport;\n    }\n\n    public Rect GetClipViewportInWorld()\n    {\n        return TileCamera.Instance.GetViewport();\n    }\n\n    Rect ExpandViewport(Rect viewport)\n    {\n        float x = viewport.x;\n        float y = viewport.y;\n        float w = viewport.width;\n        float h = viewport.height;\n\n        x -= _mapData.PixelsPerBlock.x;\n        y -= _mapData.PixelsPerBlock.y / 2f;\n        w += 2 * _mapData.PixelsPerBlock.x;\n        h += 2 * _mapData.PixelsPerBlock.y / 2f;\n\n        viewport.x = x;\n        viewport.y = y;\n        viewport.width = w;\n        viewport.height = h;\n\n        return viewport;\n    }\n\n    [Flags]\n    public enum EnumCheckType\n    {\n        ENone = 0,\n        ECheckNisa = 0x00000001, //赛季前夕地图检查\n        ETotal = ECheckNisa,\n    }\n\n    /// <summary>\n    /// 尽量使用ServerRelocationManager.GoGoToOtherLocation 或者 GoToOtherKingdom,代替这个方法\n    /// </summary>\n    /// <param name=\"location\"></param>\n    /// <param name=\"smoothTranslation\"></param>\n    /// <param name=\"checkType\"></param>\n    public void GotoLocation(Coordinate location, bool smoothTranslation,\n        EnumCheckType checkType = EnumCheckType.ETotal)\n    {\n        if ((0 != (checkType & EnumCheckType.ECheckNisa)) &&\n            !NisaSeasonCompatManager.Instance.CheckCanGotoTarget(location)) return;\n\n        if (!MapUtils.CanGotoTarget(location.K))\n        {\n            UIManager.inst.toast.Show(Utils.XLAT(\"toast_kingdom_target_different_kingdom\"), clear: true);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (TileCamera.IsAvailable())\n        {\n            TileCamera.Instance.CurViewKingdomId = location.K;\n        }\n\n        GameEngine.GameMode curGameMode = GameEngine.Instance.CurrentGameMode;\n        GameEngine.GameMode targetGameMode = MapUtils.GetGameModeByK(location.K);\n\n        //当前 game mode与要跳转的目标 mode不同，则播云切换 mode\n        //如果不想此处播云，可提前设置game mode为目标 mode\n        if (curGameMode != targetGameMode)\n        {\n            UIManager.inst.Cloud.CoverCloud(delegate\n            {\n                GameEngine.Instance.CurrentGameMode = targetGameMode;\n                PendingGotoRequest = location;\n                LookTargetLocation(location, smoothTranslation);\n            });\n        }\n        //相同则直接设置相机\n        else\n        {\n            PendingGotoRequest = location;\n            LookTargetLocation(location, smoothTranslation);\n        }\n    }\n\n    internal void DoNotHideHighlight_GotoLocation(Coordinate location, bool smoothTranslation,\n        EnumCheckType checkType = EnumCheckType.ETotal)\n    {\n        if ((0 != (checkType & EnumCheckType.ECheckNisa)) &&\n            !NisaSeasonCompatManager.Instance.CheckCanGotoTarget(location)) return;\n\n        if (!MapUtils.CanGotoTarget(location.K))\n        {\n            UIManager.inst.toast.Show(Utils.XLAT(\"toast_kingdom_target_different_kingdom\"), clear: true);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (TileCamera.IsAvailable())\n        {\n            TileCamera.Instance.CurViewKingdomId = location.K;\n        }\n\n        GameEngine.GameMode curGameMode = GameEngine.Instance.CurrentGameMode;\n        GameEngine.GameMode targetGameMode = MapUtils.GetGameModeByK(location.K);\n\n        //当前 game mode与要跳转的目标 mode不同，则播云切换 mode\n        //如果不想此处播云，可提前设置game mode为目标 mode\n        if (curGameMode != targetGameMode)\n        {\n            UIManager.inst.Cloud.CoverCloud(delegate\n            {\n                GameEngine.Instance.CurrentGameMode = targetGameMode;\n                PendingGotoRequest = location;\n                DoNotHideHighLight_LookTargetLocation(location, smoothTranslation);\n            });\n        }\n        //相同则直接设置相机\n        else\n        {\n            PendingGotoRequest = location;\n            DoNotHideHighLight_LookTargetLocation(location, smoothTranslation);\n        }\n    }\n\n\n    private void LookTargetLocation(Coordinate location, bool smoothTranslation)\n    {\n        if (TileCamera.IsAvailable())\n        {\n            UIManager.inst.CloseKingdomTouchCircle();\n            TileCamera.Instance.SetTargetLookLocation(location, smoothTranslation);\n            LookTargetLocationRaw(location, smoothTranslation);\n            MessageBroker.Default.Publish(new GotoLocationOver());\n        }\n    }\n    \n    public void LookTargetLocationRaw(Coordinate location, bool smoothTranslation)\n    {\n        if (TileCamera.IsAvailable())\n        {\n            HideHighlight();\n            \n            if (m_SpellRangeHighlight)\n            {\n                m_SpellRangeHighlight.StartDragging(null);\n            }\n\n            if (m_TeleportHighlight)\n            {\n                m_TeleportHighlight.StartDragging(null);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    internal void DoNotHideHighLight_LookTargetLocation(Coordinate location, bool smoothTranslation)\n    {\n        if (TileCamera.IsAvailable())\n        {\n            UIManager.inst.CloseKingdomTouchCircle();\n\n            if (MapUtils.IsWarZoneWorld(CurrentKXY.K) && TileCamera.Instance.ViewPortUpdated)\n            {\n                //战区block面积比较小，因此使用camera viewport coners计算的的中心点\n                //TileCamera.Instance.SetTargetCenterLocation(location, smoothTranslation);\n                TileCamera.Instance.SetTargetLookLocation(location, smoothTranslation);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                TileCamera.Instance.SetTargetLookLocation(location, smoothTranslation);\n            }\n            \n            if (m_SpellRangeHighlight)\n            {\n                //m_SpellRangeHighlight.SetLocation(_mapData.ConvertTileKXYToWorldCoordinate(location));\n                m_SpellRangeHighlight.StartDragging(null);\n            }\n\n            if (m_TeleportHighlight)\n            {\n                m_TeleportHighlight.StartDragging(null);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n\n    /*\n    public void GotoLocationWithCloud(GameEngine.GameMode gameMode, Coordinate location, bool smoothTranslation, System.Action callback = null)\n    {\n        UIManager.inst.Cloud.CoverCloud(delegate\n        {\n            GameEngine.Instance.CurrentGameMode = gameMode;\n            PendingGotoRequest = location;\n\n            if (TileCamera.IsAvailable())\n            {\n                HideHighlight();\n                CurrentKXY = location;\n                UIManager.inst.CloseKingdomTouchCircle();\n                TileCamera.Instance.CurViewKingdomId = location.K;\n                TileCamera.Instance.SetTargetLookLocation(location, smoothTranslation);\n\n                if (m_SpellRangeHighlight)\n                {\n                    m_SpellRangeHighlight.StartDragging(null);\n                }\n            }\n\n            callback?.Invoke();\n        });\n    }\n    */\n\n    Coordinate ConvertScreenPointToKXY(Vector2 screenPosition)\n    {\n        Vector3 clickPosition = ConvertScreenPositionToWorldPosition(screenPosition);\n        Coordinate kxy = _mapData.ConvertWorldPositionToTileKXY(clickPosition);\n        return kxy;\n    }\n\n    Vector3 ConvertScreenPositionToWorldPosition(Vector2 point)\n    {\n        Ray ray = TileCamera.Instance.Camera.ScreenPointToRay(point);\n        float distance = 0f;\n        if (TileCamera.Plane.Raycast(ray, out distance))\n        {\n            return ray.GetPoint(distance);\n        }\n\n        return Vector3.zero;\n    }\n\n    Vector3 ConvertViewportPositionToWorldPosition(Vector3 vp)\n    {\n        Ray ray = TileCamera.Instance.Camera.ViewportPointToRay(vp);\n\n        float distance = 0f;\n        if (TileCamera.Plane.Raycast(ray, out distance))\n        {\n            return ray.GetPoint(distance);\n        }\n\n        return Vector3.zero;\n    }\n\n    Vector3 ConvertScreenPositionToPixelPosition(Vector2 screenPosition)\n    {\n        float scale = 1.0f / GameEngine.Instance.tileMapScale;\n        Vector3 worldPosition = ConvertScreenPositionToWorldPosition(screenPosition);\n        return scale * worldPosition;\n    }\n\n    public Vector3 GetCameraPixelPosition()\n    {\n        return InverseTileMapScale * TileCamera.Instance.GetLookAtPosition();\n    }\n\n    #region highlight\n\n    private string _lastHighlightPath;\n\n    private void ClearHighlight()\n    {\n        if (_highlight)\n        {\n            Destroy(_highlight);\n            _highlight = null;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private GameObject GetHighlight()\n    {\n        var curHighlight = \"\";\n        var mode = MapUtils.GetGameModeByK(CurrentKXY.K);\n        switch (mode)\n        {\n            case GameEngine.GameMode.FantasyMode:\n                curHighlight = MapUtils.TILE_HIGHLIGHT_FANTASY;\n                break;\n            \n            default:\n                curHighlight = MapUtils.TILE_HIGHLIGHT;\n                break;\n        }\n\n        if (curHighlight != _lastHighlightPath)\n        {\n            ClearHighlight();\n\n            var highlight = AssetManagerEx.Instance.Instantiate(curHighlight);\n            _lastHighlightPath = curHighlight;\n\n            return highlight;\n        }\n\n        return _highlight;\n    }\n    \n    private void DestroyMarchArrow()\n    {\n        if (_marchArrow)\n        {\n            Destroy(_marchArrow);\n            _marchArrow = null;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private GameObject GetMarchArrow()\n    {\n        if (!_marchArrow)\n        {\n            var marchArrow = AssetManagerEx.Instance.Instantiate(MapUtils.MARCH_ARROW);\n            _marchArrow = marchArrow;\n        }\n\n        return _marchArrow;\n    }\n    \n    public IEnumerator AutoOpenMapMonsterPanel(Coordinate location, TileType targetType)\n    {\n        yield return null;\n        yield return null;\n        float spendTime = 0;\n        var curMode = GameEngine.Instance.CurrentGameMode;\n        var cor = location;\n                \n        while (true)\n        {\n            switch (targetType)\n            {\n                case TileType.GveCamp:\n                case TileType.Encounter:\n                case TileType.Fake_Slg_Monster:\n                case TileType.Fake_Level_Monster:\n                case TileType.Fake_Rescue_Monster:\n                case TileType.TILE_GENERAL_TRIALS_USER:\n                case TileType.TILE_NEW_WORLD_BOSS:\n                {\n                    bool ret1 = GameEngine.Instance.CurrentGameMode == curMode;\n                    bool ret2 = CurrentKXY == cor;\n                    if (ret1 && ret2)\n                    {\n                        var data = PVPMapData.MapData.GetReferenceAt(location);\n                        if (data != null && data.TileType == targetType)\n                        {\n                            SyncCurrentXYZToCache();\n                            ShowCircleAt(location);\n                            yield break;\n                        }\n                                \n                        if (spendTime < 3)\n                        {\n                            spendTime += Time.deltaTime;\n                            yield return null;\n                        }\n                        else\n                        {\n                            yield break;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        yield break;\n                    }\n                }\n                    break;\n                default:\n                    yield break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n\n    #endregion\n\n    public void ShowHighlight(Vector3 position, Vector3 scale, bool showIntelHit = false)\n    {\n        _highlight = GetHighlight();\n        if (!_highlight)\n            return;\n\n        if (null == this || !gameObject)\n            return;\n\n        _highlight.transform.parent = gameObject.transform;\n        position.z = 0;\n\n        _highlight.transform.localPosition = position;\n        _highlight.transform.rotation = Quaternion.identity;\n        _highlight.transform.localScale = scale;\n        _highlight.SetActive(true);\n\n        //新情报\n        if (showIntelHit)\n        {\n            if (PVPSystem.Instance != null)\n                PVPSystem.Instance.ShowIntelligentHintObject(_highlight.transform);\n        }\n        else if (PVPSystem.Instance != null)\n        {\n            PVPSystem.Instance.HideIntelligentHintObject();\n        }\n\n        ShowKingdomTaskMarker();\n    }\n\n    void ShowPassHighlight(TileData tileData)\n    {\n        // take care multi-tiles highlight if there is one\n\n        var position = new Vector3(tileData.Position.x,\n            tileData.Position.y - (tileData.SizeY - 1) * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.y * 0.5f,\n            tileData.Position.z - 150);\n        Vector3 scale = new Vector3(tileData.SizeX * 1.13f, tileData.SizeY * 1.13f, 1.0f);\n        ShowPassHighlight(position, scale);\n        ShowBuildingBorder(tileData);\n    }\n\n    private void ShowPassHighlight(Vector3 position, Vector3 scale)\n    {\n        var light = AssetManagerEx.Instance.Instantiate(MapUtils.TILE_HIGHLIGHT);\n        light.transform.parent = gameObject.transform;\n        position.z = 0;\n        \n        var go = AssetManagerEx.Instance.Instantiate(MapUtils.TILE_HIGHLIGHT);\n        go.transform.parent = gameObject.transform;\n        go.transform.localPosition = position;\n        go.transform.rotation = Quaternion.identity;\n        go.transform.localScale = scale;\n        go.SetActive(true);\n\n        passHightLightList.Add(go);\n        ShowKingdomTaskMarker();\n    }\n\n\n    public void ShowWallHighlight(Vector3 position, Vector3 scale)\n    {\n        if (_wallHighlight == null)\n            _wallHighlight = AssetManagerEx.Instance.Instantiate(MapUtils.TILE_WALL_HIGHLIGHT);\n\n        _wallHighlight.transform.parent = gameObject.transform;\n        position.z = 0;\n\n        _wallHighlight.transform.localPosition = position;\n        _wallHighlight.transform.rotation = Quaternion.identity;\n        _wallHighlight.transform.localScale = Vector3.one;\n        _wallHighlight.GetComponent<SpriteRenderer>().size = scale;\n        _wallHighlight.SetActive(true);\n    }\n\n    bool GetTileCenterPosition(TileData tileData, out Vector3 position)\n    {\n        position = Vector3.zero;\n\n        if (tileData == null)\n            return false;\n\n        if (tileData.UseReference)\n            tileData = _mapData.GetReferenceAt(tileData.Location.K, tileData.Reference.x, tileData.Reference.y);\n\n        position = new Vector3(tileData.Position.x,\n            tileData.Position.y - (tileData.SizeY - 1 + tileData.PosOffY) * _mapData.PixelsPerTile.y * 0.5f, 0);\n\n      